        <mxCell id="plLegT3" value="What starts what, and where the data lands. Garmin data runs left to right (acquire, validate, store, broker, outputs); context data runs in parallel on the top row. Module calls are in the Data Flow Diagram, per-step decisions in the Decision Flow diagram." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=11;fontColor=#aaaaaa;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
